\strong{How the support reference is constructed}

\strong{Local same-year fallback}

When `keep_pool = NULL`, the support reference is derived internally
from the same target year being scored.

More precisely, the local reference is constructed from the internal
same-year keep core defined by:
\itemize{
  \item candidate polygons entering the Stage-2 keep/review layer,
  \item restricted to polygons with `flag_internal == "keep"`.
